Repack's skyboxes use the idea of SkyboxEngine and its SkyboxTemplate (https://github.com/Dragoncraft000/SkyboxEngine): a display that surrounds each
player, drawn by the item shader of the pack, which tells a sky by a code in the alpha of its sprite and reads the sky of a picture the same way.
